# The bare !.env negation above (for this repo's own root .env) unignores
# any file literally named .env anywhere in the tree by accident -- re-ignore
# this one specifically, since it's the operator's own prior PentAGI install
# with real plaintext secrets (Langfuse S3/Redis, scraper creds), not
# repo-tracked config.
docs/pentagi-stack/original/

